    "text": "The Crawdaunt ex deck from the Gift Box Mew・Lucario ver., released on 16 November 2005 and themed on the film Lucario and the Mystery of Mew. The box held four ready-built 15-card decks, built around Mew ex, Folklore's Lucario ex, Crawdaunt ex and Mightyena ex, two Pokémon ☆ cards, a coin, damage counters and markers, a playmat, a rule book and a tin carrying case."
  },
